            <div xml:id="d1371">

                <pb facs="1070" n="954" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg954"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.512/911.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Parker,
                        representing American interests in Mexico, to the Secretary
                            of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexico City</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-11-22">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 22, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>161. My 59, September 8. Department of Finance published yesterday an
                    authorization to governors of states to collect the proportionable tax on mines
                    corresponding to each state on Mexican gold basis, which implies a further
                    increase on the recently augmented tax.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Parker.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
